    "attributes": {
      "name": "Color Tree",
      "summary": "The ColorTree defines a configurable color visualization component used within app/card/field/skill/theme contexts. It allows selection of a color and a Munsell notation, and dynamically generates a title based on the selected Munsell value. The component supports multiple presentation modes, including isolated, embedded, and fitted variations, to suit different layout needs. Its primary purpose is to enable intuitive display and interaction with color information within a structured card-based interface.",
